{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51989","headline":"入阙咏空镜台诗 · 陈叔达","name":"入阙咏空镜台诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"即今装饰废，雕零衢路间。\n姮娥与明月，相共落关山。\n（见中华书局排印本唐徐坚等纂《初学记》卷二十五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈叔达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}